# Local working material, not part of the site.
#
# documents/ is the drop folder for source files (spreadsheets, the original
# hero photographs at full size). The versions the site actually serves live in
# public/images/ and are committed; these are the 55MB of originals they were
# made from, which would bloat the repository permanently for no benefit.
/documents/

# Dated backups taken by hand before a risky change.
/.icon-backup-*
